Common Reviewer
    documentation "The person who conducted the performance measure."
    shared string FirstName
        documentation "A name given to an individual at birth, baptism, or during another naming ceremony, or through legal change."
        is part of identity
        is sensitive data
    shared string LastSurname
        documentation "The name borne in common by members of a family."
        is part of identity
        is sensitive data
    common ReceivedTraining
        documentation "An indication that the person administering the performance evaluation has or has not received training on conducting performance measures."
        is optional
    domain entity Person
        documentation "The person associated with the performance measure."
        is optional
        role name Reviewer
